    "file-backed module's body is not a program (`spec/17` §5). Location: the root `main`, if there is o"
    "ne; otherwise the program as a whole.\n- `diag.const-not-constant` — Summary: a constant's value mu"
    "st be known before the program runs. Phase: static. Rule: `rule.module.const` `[Const-Not-Constant]`"
    ", `[Const-Cycle]`, `[Const-Local-Not-Constant]` (`spec/17` §1a). Invariant: none. Required: a `cons"
    "t`'s type is not a resource, its initializer is a constant expression (literals, operators, other co"
    "nstants, struct, array and variant literals of constant expressions and their fields and elements, a"
    " function's name, the pure intrinsics listed there), and no constant depends on itself; a local cons"
    "tant's initializer names no local variable and no type parameter of its function. Observed: one of t"
