    "exically inside a `while` / function body. Repair: move the statement.\n- `diag.capture-list-mismatch"
    "` — Summary: the capture list does not match the names the closure uses. Phase: static. Rule: `rul"
    "e.fn.closure` `[Closure-Capture-List-Rejected]`. Invariant: none (a well-formedness check on the clo"
