    "the missing name(s) or remove the unused one(s); the list documents an already-derived fact, it cann"
    "ot select a different capture set. Related: `ex.closure-capture`.\n\n## Validity of access paths\n\n- `d"
    "iag.stale-binding` — Summary: this value is no longer valid. Phase: both. Rule: `[Binding-Lookup-S"
    "tale]`, `[Read-Stale]`, `[Write-Stale]`, `[Borrow-Stale]`, `[Field-Access-Stale]`, `[Destroy-Stale]`"
    ", `[Fn-Value-Empty-Call]`. Invariant: `inv.temporal-validity`. Required: `temporally-valid(a)`. Obse"
    "rved: false. Provenance: the invalidating event (object end at frame exit, last holder ended, statem"
