    "r: use the current holder after a move, or give the binding a new value first (`x = e`, `spec/11` `["
    "Assign-Reestablish]`); do not keep a reference past its referent's or its holder's scope; re-index a"
    "fter a `Vec` reallocation. Related: `ex.use-after-move`, `ex.double-destroy`.\n- `diag.use-of-uniniti"
    "alized` — Summary: this is used before it has a value. Phase: static (`rule.init.definite-assignme"
    "nt`, rejects on unknown); dynamic guard `[Read-Uninitialized]`, `[Write-Partial-Init]`. Invariant: `"
