    "ert`, or in the caller.\n- `diag.result-source-kept` — Summary: this keeps a reference parameter th"
    "e `from` clause does not name. Phase: static. Rule: `rule.temporal.elision` `[Result-Source-Probe-On"
    "ly]` (D-0312, D-0318). Invariant: `inv.temporal-validity`. Required: every reference parameter the c"
    "lause does not name is only probed: read for a value that holds no reference of it. Observed: an occ"
